<title>USA: Missouri lean hog carcass values - Nov 22.</title>
<headline>Missouri lean hog carcass values - Nov 22.</headline>
<dateline>JEFFERSON CITY, MO 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Plant delivered prices on lean slaughter hogs were steady to 0.50 higher than Thursday's close. -- USDA</p>
<p>Price range (dollars/cwt) -</p>
<p>-- 50 percent lean, carcass weight of 178-190 lbs</p>
<p>	 75.32-76.51</p>
<p>-- 52-53 percent lean with a carcass weight of 182-195 lbs</p>
<p>	 81.00-81.80</p>
<p>Estimated Receipts: 660</p>
<p>Note: Producer reported prices with grade premiums or discounts included.</p>
<p>Source: Missouri Department of Agriculture-USDA Livestock Market News</p>
<p>(Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8720)</p>
</text>
